<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Fernandez to lead U.K. finance mission.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Fernandez to lead U.K. finance mission.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Economy Minister Roque Fernandez begins a week-long visit to Britain Monday aimed at promoting Buenos Aires as a regional financial center.</p>
<p>Fernandez will participate in a conference attended by Britain's Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke and visit the Bank of England and several private investment firms.</p>
<p>&quot;It is important to present Buenos Aires as a center for financial services,&quot; the Under-Secretary for Banking and Insurance Francisco Susmel said of the visit.</p>
</text>
